    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρ-ευτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hunter</i>, epith. of Apollo as slayer of <i><span class="en">
				Python
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1091
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				297.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>: metaph., of sleep, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πτηνοῦ φάσματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.125
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες ἀ.</span>
			<i>hounds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κάλαμοι</span> a fowler's
				<i>trap of reeds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.171
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mnasalc.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.109
			</span></i> (Antip.).</div>
